  "rulings": {
    "references": [
      {
        "link": "https://world.digimoncard.com/rule/?card_no=EX5-062#qaResult_card",
        "num": 1,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for EX5-062 (Mar. 28, 2024)"
      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "It means that when you use this effect to play 1 purple Digimon card from your trash with the play cost reduced by 3, you can further reduce it by 1 for each card trashed from your hand.  For example, if you used this effect to trash 2 cards from your hand, you can play 1 purple Digimon card from your trash with its play cost reduced by 5.",
        "question": "What does \"for each card trashed by this effect, further reduce it by 1\" in this card's [When Digivolving][Main] effect mean, exactly?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes. That's correct.",
        "question": "If I don't trash any cards from my hand, can I use this card’s [When Digivolving][Main] effect to play a purple Digimon card from my trash with its play cost reduced by 3?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, you can.",
        "question": "When I use this card’s [When Digivolving][Main] effect to trash a purple Digimon card from my hand, can I choose that card as the card to play from my trash?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't.  Even if a single effect plays multiple Digimon at the same time, you can only use this effect to delete 1 of your opponent's level 5 or lower Digimon, or use it to ＜Draw 1＞ once.",
        "question": "When a single effect plays 2 or more of my Digimon at the same time, can I use this card's [Your Turn] effect to delete 2 of my opponent's level 5 or lower Digimon, or use it to ＜Draw 1＞ twice?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it activates.",
        "question": "Does this card's [Your Turn] effect activate when this card's effect itself plays a card?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
